  "main": "\n\n<section class=\"pt-40 pb-24\">\n\t<div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-6 md:px-12\">\n\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center eyebrow\"><span>Journal</span></div>\t\t<div class=\"tsc-journal-heading\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"max-w-3xl font-serif text-[2.25rem] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[3rem]\">\n\t\t\tConsidered writing on medicine, longevity and the practice of care.\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-journal-search-wrap\">\n\t\t\t<form class=\"tsc-journal-search\" role=\"search\" action=\"/journal/\" method=\"get\">\n\t\t\t\t<label class=\"screen-reader-text\" for=\"journal-search\">Search the journal</label>\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\" /><path d=\"m20 20-3.5-3.5\" /></svg>\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"journal-search\" name=\"journal_search\" type=\"search\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Search the journal\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"submit\">Search</button>\n\t\t\t</form>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-journal-search__status is-empty\" role=\"status\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p aria-hidden=\"true\">&#160;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\">&#160;</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<nav class=\"tsc-journal-filters\" aria-label=\"Filter journal articles\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/journal/\" aria-current=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tAll\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/journal/?journal_type=insights\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tClinical Insights\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/journal/?journal_type=research\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch Papers\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</nav>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 md:grid-cols-3\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"tsc-journal-card-link group\" href=\"/your-bloods-came-back-normal-why-do-you-still-feel-exhausted/\">\n<article class=\"tsc-journal-card flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--muted)]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/2;margin-bottom:2rem\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/normal-bloods-persistent-fatigue-v3.webp\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.04] wp-post-image\" alt=\"Three unused blood collection tubes resting on a laboratory results sheet\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/normal-bloods-persistent-fatigue-v3.webp 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/normal-bloods-persistent-fatigue-v3-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/normal-bloods-persistent-fatigue-v3-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/normal-bloods-persistent-fatigue-v3-768x432.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\">\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\">\n\t\t<span style=\"color:var(--bronze)\">Systems Medicine</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">5 min read</span>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h3 class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[2rem]\">\n\t\t<span class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Your Bloods Came Back Normal. Why Do You Still Feel Exhausted?</span>\n\t</h3>\n\n\t<p class=\"mt-6 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">\n\t\tA normal blood panel rules out disease. It was never designed to measure how well your cells produce energy. Why fatigue can persist, and what a fuller look involves.\t</p>\n\n\t<span class=\"tsc-journal-card__read mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[color:var(--border)] pt-6 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] transition-colors group-hover:text-foreground\" style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n\t\tRead\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span>\n\t</span>\n</article>\n</a>\n<a class=\"tsc-journal-card-link group\" href=\"/what-supplements-should-i-actually-be-taking/\">\n<article class=\"tsc-journal-card flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--muted)]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/2;margin-bottom:2rem\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Supps2.jpeg\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.04] wp-post-image\" alt=\"Supplements in spoons\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Supps2.jpeg 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Supps2-300x169.jpeg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Supps2-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Supps2-768x432.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\">\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\">\n\t\t<span style=\"color:var(--bronze)\">Systems Medicine</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">5 min read</span>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h3 class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[2rem]\">\n\t\t<span class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">What Supplements Should I Actually Be Taking?</span>\n\t</h3>\n\n\t<p class=\"mt-6 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">\n\t\tThere is no universal supplement stack. Why a cupboard of bottles is not a health plan, and how to decide what you actually need.\t</p>\n\n\t<span class=\"tsc-journal-card__read mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[color:var(--border)] pt-6 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] transition-colors group-hover:text-foreground\" style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n\t\tRead\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span>\n\t</span>\n</article>\n</a>\n<a class=\"tsc-journal-card-link group\" href=\"/glp-1-medications-what-still-determines-whether-it-lasts/\">\n<article class=\"tsc-journal-card flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--muted)]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/2;margin-bottom:2rem\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glp1-what-still-determines-whether-it-lasts.webp\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.04] wp-post-image\" alt=\"A simple plate of roasted vegetables and salmon on a cream stone table\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glp1-what-still-determines-whether-it-lasts.webp 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glp1-what-still-determines-whether-it-lasts-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glp1-what-still-determines-whether-it-lasts-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/glp1-what-still-determines-whether-it-lasts-768x432.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\">\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\">\n\t\t<span style=\"color:var(--bronze)\">Systems Medicine</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">6 min read</span>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h3 class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[2rem]\">\n\t\t<span class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">GLP-1 Medications Changed the Conversation About Weight. Here Is What Still Determines Whether It Lasts.</span>\n\t</h3>\n\n\t<p class=\"mt-6 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">\n\t\tGLP-1 medications are a genuine breakthrough in weight and metabolic medicine. What still determines whether the result lasts is the metabolic picture underneath, and the habits built while the food noise is quiet.\t</p>\n\n\t<span class=\"tsc-journal-card__read mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[color:var(--border)] pt-6 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] transition-colors group-hover:text-foreground\" style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n\t\tRead\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span>\n\t</span>\n</article>\n</a>\n<a class=\"tsc-journal-card-link group\" href=\"/when-the-mind-and-the-metabolism-are-not-separate-problems/\">\n<article class=\"tsc-journal-card flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--muted)]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/2;margin-bottom:2rem\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/mind-and-metabolism-are-not-separate.webp\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.04] wp-post-image\" alt=\"A ceramic bowl of berries and walnuts beside a glass of water and a small amber vial\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/mind-and-metabolism-are-not-separate.webp 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/mind-and-metabolism-are-not-separate-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/mind-and-metabolism-are-not-separate-1024x576.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/mind-and-metabolism-are-not-separate-768x432.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\">\t\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\">\n\t\t<span style=\"color:var(--bronze)\">Systems Medicine</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">7 min read</span>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h3 class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[1.75rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[2rem]\">\n\t\t<span class=\"transition-colors group-hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">When the Mind and the Metabolism Are Not Separate Problems</span>\n\t</h3>\n\n\t<p class=\"mt-6 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">\n\t\tMood, concentration and creeping blood sugar are often treated as separate problems. The research increasingly suggests they may be one process, seen from three angles.\t</p>\n\n\t<span class=\"tsc-journal-card__read mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[color:var(--border)] pt-6 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] transition-colors group-hover:text-foreground\" style=\"margin-top:auto\">\n\t\tRead\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2\">→</span>\n\t</span>\n</article>\n</a>\n<a class=\"tsc-journal-card-link group\" href=\"/andropause-why-male-menopause-gets-it-wrong/\">\n<article class=\"tsc-journal-card flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[color:var(--muted)]\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/2;margin-bottom:2rem\">\n\t\t\t<img width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/andropause-why-male-menopause-gets-it-wrong.webp\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.04] wp-post-image\" alt=\"A man in his late forties sitting in a quiet cream-walled room, looking out of frame\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/andropause-why-male-menopause-gets-it-wrong.webp 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/andropause-why-male-menopause-gets-it-wrong-300x169.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/09/andropause-why-male-menopause-gets